      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I really don't think this is what trust ranks should be used for or that it should be displayed in any form on the nameplate.\n\nBut a reward in general would be highly appreciated for investing in so many hours into the localization process. \n\nA profile badge would be perfect, among other bonus things.\n\nExtra things like (random ideas):\n\n- VRC+ subscription.\n\n- Merch.\n\n- In-game or social media recognition.\n\n- Trust rank boost.\n\n- Official VRC group.\n\n- Role on the official VRChat Discord.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
