  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello, I had an idea for a reward for people who helped with the localization of VRChat.\n\nMy suggestion is that we could get a localization role that can be toggleable, allowing us to appear as a normal user or a Localization role, similar to the VRChat Team role; this role would only be cosmetic.",
